// Test: under @exec_time_resolvers a client edge to an interface implemented by
// both a server type (`ServerVehicle`) and a client model (`ClientVehicle`)
// compiles. The edge keeps the sparse `modelResolvers` map read time already
// uses (client arms only) and one shared `linkedField`, and no per-implementor
// `ClientEdgeQuery` is generated -- exec time has no refetch path, so a server
// arm is reachable only when its record is already available.
//- MixedVehicle.js
graphql`query MixedVehicleQuery @exec_time_resolvers {
  vehicle {
    common_name
    ... on ServerVehicle {
      server_name
    }
    ... on ClientVehicle {
      client_name
    }
  }
}`

